{"type":"Film","id":"DE2015_109","slug":"de2015-109-erich-mielke-meister-der-angst","title":{"native":"Erich Mielke - Meister der Angst","english":"Erich Mielke - Master of Fear"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-11-05","year":2015},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Jens Becker","slug":"jens-becker","name":"Jens Becker","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Maarten van der Duin","slug":"maarten-van-der-duin","name":"Maarten van der Duin","birthYear":1967,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Netherlands (the)","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Performative mode"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5253610/mediaviewer/rm3941404928/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tt9FVDDOt3Q&ab_channel=vipmagazinKino"},"synopsis":{"native":"Erich Mielke als einer der umstrittensten Politiker der DDR, aber auch als Mensch, der seinem Volk misstraute und dennoch die Liebe seiner Untergebenen einforderte – in all diesen Facetten versuchen die Filmemacher Jens Becker und Maarten van der Duin den „Meister der Angst“ zu beleuchten, einen Mann, über den der CIA und der BND Akten führten und der dennoch bis heute eine undurchsichtige Figur bleibt. In dem Dokudrama nähern sich die Regisseure der Karriere und dem Privatleben Mielkes einerseits auf dokumentarischer Ebene, zeigen Interviews und Archivmaterial, aber auch auf Spielfilmebene. Kaspar Eichel schlüpft in die Rolle von Mielke und spielt Szenen aus dessen Zeit in der Berliner Justizvollzugsanstalt Moabit nach, in der er im Gespräch mit einer Psychologin sein Leben resümiert. Erich Mielke, der 1957 zum Minister für Staatssicherheit der DDR aufstieg und wie kein zweiter die Stasi prägte, wurde 1993 vom Landgericht Berlin wegen Mordes verurteilt.","english":"Two teenagers are missing after a rave party in a secretive place. One of them is the son of the local police force chief. A massive manhunt is carried out."},"production":[{"country":"Germany","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Jens Becker","slug":"jens-becker","name":"Jens Becker","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Karl-Fred Müller","slug":"karl-fred-muller","name":"Karl-Fred Müller","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":2018,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Kaspar Eichel","slug":"kaspar-eichel","name":"Kaspar Eichel","birthYear":1942,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Leading actor"},{"person":{"id":"Maarten van der Duin","slug":"maarten-van-der-duin","name":"Maarten van der Duin","birthYear":1967,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Netherlands (the)","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Nikita Petrov","slug":"nikita-petrov","name":"Nikita Petrov","birthYear":1957,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Russian Federation (the)","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Nikolai Leonov","slug":"nikolai-leonov","name":"Nikolai Leonov","birthYear":1928,"deathYear":2022,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Russian Federation (the)","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Peter Rauch","slug":"peter-rauch","name":"Peter Rauch","birthYear":1947,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Roland Jahn","slug":"roland-jahn","name":"Roland Jahn","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Stefan König","slug":"stefan-konig","name":"Stefan König","birthYear":1955,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Unknown"